@title Controller card: two controllers, the filter lists all of them (1920)
@area Live
@sizes 1920x1080
# Lane C3. The 1920x1080 twin of 5632: add a pendant next to the radio; the controller picker of the
# filter bar lists both and "All controllers" shows the signals of both (15 + 13).
open qa/fixtures/radio-hoist.novo
wait 20
key shift+l
wait 20
click_text "Controller…"
wait 20
click_text "+ Add"
wait 10
shot add-menu
click_text "Wired pendant, 3 motions, 2-step"
wait 20
scroll 1700 500 -1500
wait 10
shot two-controllers
expect "This controller"
click_text "This controller"
wait 10
shot scope-menu
expect "Radio, 3 motions, 2-step"
expect "Wired pendant, 3 motions, 2-step"
click_text "All controllers"
wait 10
shot all-controllers
expect "All controllers"
expect "of 28 high)"
check_layout
